WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:05.520
I've reached a point in my career, where I
was working with heads of

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.860
all the different functional areas in our
business.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.800
I'd never taken a business course in my
life.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.000
I have graduate degrees in psychology.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.210
So I really wanted to deepen my
understanding of those different

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:20.840
functional areas so that I could do my job
and lead my team more effectively.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.510
I found SEP really compelling.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:27.340
Every minute of it has been so carefully
thought through.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:31.390
Things that previously I understood in
kind of a superficial level.

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:34.720
I had a much deeper understanding and in
fact I could tell a story to

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.420
our investors about what we were doing and
why we were doing it.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.250
In a way that I wasn't able to do
previously.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:47.360
Innovation is an approach to doing things,
not just an event, or a series of events.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.060
And that was something that crystalized
for me.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.280
Being able to make it real within the
corporate marketing function here at

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.495
FICO was really important to me.

00:00:56.495 --> 00:01:01.060
SEP was an accellerant not just for me,
but for my whole team.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.600
What I found upon my return to work,

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.780
was that my team had really grown a great
deal.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:12.240
Now we're all operating at a higher level
than we were before and

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.400
we are going to continue in this
direction.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:21.300
SEP was a transformational experience for
me, it gave me the tools and

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:26.340
the language to create more value within
my business, for

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:31.010
myself, for my team, for our organization
and our contributions to society.

